load @term/seed/code/structure/set
  find set

# A rewriting system: a set of rules that replace one pattern by another, computing by repeated local replacement until
# nothing more applies. Term rewriting, graph rewriting, and string rewriting are its forms, and a rewriting system is
# confluent when the order of rewrites does not change the result. The substrate computes by local rewriting on the
# mesh. The form carries the set of terms; the rules are the rewrites.
form rewriting-system
  link terms, like set
